      {
        "id": 226137,
        "name": "Andy7675",
        "username": "Andy7675",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/b3f665/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-17T06:05:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Literally all you need to beat this is legacy. Use legacy to take all the damage for everyone and ignore pretty much all the damage. Energy or Infernal, then use Argent Adept to have Legs be immune to the other. The rest of your team just needs to blow him up quick because immuning his damage means the counters go up fast.</p>\n<p>i got a 0 heroes eliminated win against Oblivaeon with Legacy, Santa Guise, The Scholar, Setback, and Benchmark.</p>\n<p>i've also had remarkable success with Chronoranger turbo, Super Sentai Idealist, or with Freedom Five Tachyon as my main damage dealer.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Legacy is your boy.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Good luck</p>",
