      {
        "id": 226138,
        "name": "committed hero",
        "username": "committed_hero",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/48db29/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-17T19:37:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't mind a random setup, except that I want five heroes. I will also remove The Celestial Tribunal since OblivAeon can waste a 10HP hero in one turn (as an aisde, really my only&nbsp;dislike about this mode is when I summon a new hero who goes down before getting&nbsp;a single turn).</p>\n<p>I'll slot in Panzerbuster Bunker and Stuntman once Voss appears. If you can get the latter towards the start of the heroes' roster you might skip the villain turns with the&nbsp;Dramatic Cliffhanger/In Medias Res combo.</p>\n<p>For Phase 3, Legacy and Nightmist are at the top of the list for deck lockdown.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:57.913Z",
