      {
        "id": 226140,
        "name": "The Grim Digger",
        "username": "The_Grim_Digger",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3e96dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-23T02:21:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Agree with committed hero on avoiding environments with insta-loss conditions beyond your control.&nbsp; Mobile Defense Platform is also a risk, although frankly the idea of OblivAeon plummeting to his death because the engine blew up is almost funny enough to chance it.</p>",
