      {
        "id": 226141,
        "name": "DrGraviton",
        "username": "DrGraviton",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/drgraviton/{size}/1949_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-04-12T17:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. First stage : destroy shield, get rewards, get strong ko powers. When’d the shield is destroyed Oblivaeon flips page and hp drops to 180.</p>\n<p>2. For stage 2 just let countdown goes to 0 while fighting Xions&nbsp;and aeon men. Do not let that a battle zone have more Xions&nbsp;than heroes. Keep on getting strong rewards and ko powers. After count down reaches 0 Oblivaeon flips again and is reduced to 120hp.</p>\n<p>3. Destroy remaining Xions&nbsp;in battle zones ( they will not be summoned at Oblivion’s end turn any more) and hit oblivion hard with everything you have. Cursor reward&nbsp;is great at this time against&nbsp;oblivion cards at the end of every hero’s turn. Good luck!</p>",
